# clang-tidy configuration for the tests: the top-level .clang-tidy, less
# the checks below. nix/analysis/fuzz/.clang-tidy turns off the same ones
# for the fuzz harnesses.
---
InheritParentConfig: true
Checks:
  # A test checks what the code writes against literal values, which is
  # clearer than naming each one
  - -readability-magic-numbers
  - -cppcoreguidelines-avoid-magic-numbers
  # A test is a long, linear scenario whose branches are its checks, and
  # splitting it up scatters the scenario
  - -readability-function-cognitive-complexity
